Subject: [PATCH 11/26] ASoC: codecs: wcd-mbhc: Use guard() for mutex locks
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 11:53:12 +0700
Message-ID: <20260723045327.28260-12-phucduc.bui@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.43.0
In-Reply-To: <20260723045327.28260-1-phucduc.bui@gmail.com>
